14	 * `it`, `es` — `config/sites.overlay.js`). This predicate has no site config of its own to
15	 * derive the list from (it only receives already-extracted strings), so the four are named here
16	 * directly rather than threaded through as a parameter nothing else currently needs.
17	 */
